(9, 3, 'en', 'Oil and Gas Engineering', 'Oil and Gas Engineering is offered by the Faculty of Technology with department-based theoretical study, laboratory training and industrial practice.', 'Admission requirements are defined by the current admission rules and the university admissions office.', 'Passport or identity document, education certificate and other documents requested during the admission process.', 'The curriculum includes core department subjects, laboratory work, industrial practice and a graduation project.', 'Graduates can work in industrial enterprises, laboratories, quality-control units, design organizations and research institutions.', '60721100 - Oil and Gas Engineering', 'Oil and Gas Engineering is offered by the Faculty of Technology with department-based theoretical study, laboratory training and industrial practice.', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:54'),
(10, 3, 'uz', 'Oil and Gas Engineering', 'Oil and Gas Engineering yo‘nalishi Texnologiya fakultetida kafedra bazasidagi nazariy, laboratoriya va ishlab chiqarish amaliyoti bilan olib boriladi.', 'Qabul talablari amaldagi qabul qoidalari va universitet qabul komissiyasi orqali belgilanadi.', 'Pasport, ta’lim hujjati va qabul jarayonida talab qilinadigan boshqa hujjatlar.', 'O‘quv reja kafedraning asosiy fanlari, laboratoriya ishlari, ishlab chiqarish amaliyoti va bitiruv malakaviy ishini qamrab oladi.', 'Bitiruvchilar ishlab chiqarish korxonalari, laboratoriyalar, sifat nazorati bo‘limlari, loyiha va ilmiy-tadqiqot tashkilotlarida faoliyat yuritishi mumkin.', '60721100 - Oil and Gas Engineering', 'Oil and Gas Engineering yo‘nalishi Texnologiya fakultetida kafedra bazasidagi nazariy, laboratoriya va ishlab chiqarish amaliyoti bilan olib boriladi.', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:54'),
(11, 3, 'ru', 'Oil and Gas Engineering', 'Программа Oil and Gas Engineering реализуется на факультете технологии с кафедральной теоретической подготовкой, лабораторными занятиями и производственной практикой.', 'Требования к поступлению определяются действующими правилами приёма и приёмной комиссией университета.', 'Паспорт, документ об образовании и другие документы, требуемые в процессе приёма.', 'Учебный план включает профильные дисциплины кафедры, лабораторные работы, производственную практику и выпускную квалификационную работу.', 'Выпускники могут работать на производственных предприятиях, в лабораториях, отделах контроля качества, проектных и научно-исследовательских организациях.', '60721100 - Oil and Gas Engineering', 'Программа Oil and Gas Engineering реализуется на факультете технологии с кафедральной теоретической подготовкой, лабораторными занятиями и производственной практикой.', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:54'),
(12, 3, 'ar', 'Oil and Gas Engineering', 'يُقدَّم برنامج Oil and Gas Engineering في كلية التكنولوجيا من خلال إعداد نظري ومختبري وتدريب عملي مرتبط بالقسم.', 'تُحدَّد متطلبات القبول وفق لوائح القبول المعمول بها ومن خلال لجنة القبول في الجامعة.', 'جواز السفر أو وثيقة الهوية، ووثيقة التعليم، وأي مستندات أخرى مطلوبة أثناء إجراءات القبول.', 'تشمل الخطة الدراسية مقررات القسم الأساسية، والعمل المخبري، والتدريب الصناعي، ومشروع التخرج.', 'يمكن للخريجين العمل في المؤسسات الإنتاجية والمختبرات وأقسام مراقبة الجودة ومؤسسات التصميم والبحث العلمي.', '60721100 - Oil and Gas Engineering', 'يُقدَّم برنامج Oil and Gas Engineering في كلية التكنولوجيا من خلال إعداد نظري ومختبري وتدريب عملي مرتبط بالقسم.', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:54'),
(13, 4, 'en', 'Automotive Engineering', 'Automotive systems design, internal combustion engines, transport logistics, and vehicle assembly.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Physics and Mathematics exams\nCAD modeling skills recommended', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Vehicle Design and Dynamics\nInternal Combustion Engines\nAutomotive Electronics\nTransmission Systems\nVehicle Safety Standards\nTransportation Logistics', 'Automotive Design Engineer\nAssembly Line Manager\nVehicle Safety Auditor\nAutomotive Electronics Specialist\nLogistics Engineer', 'Automotive Engineering Bachelor', 'The Automotive Engineering program covers vehicle design, engine performance, transmission systems, automotive electronics, and assembly logistics. Given the scale of automotive manufacturing in Uzbek', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:44'),
(14, 4, 'uz', 'Automotive Engineering', 'Automotive systems design, internal combustion engines, transport logistics, and vehicle assembly.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Physics and Mathematics exams\nCAD modeling skills recommended', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Vehicle Design and Dynamics\nInternal Combustion Engines\nAutomotive Electronics\nTransmission Systems\nVehicle Safety Standards\nTransportation Logistics', 'Automotive Design Engineer\nAssembly Line Manager\nVehicle Safety Auditor\nAutomotive Electronics Specialist\nLogistics Engineer', 'Automotive Engineering Bachelor', 'The Automotive Engineering program covers vehicle design, engine performance, transmission systems, automotive electronics, and assembly logistics. Given the scale of automotive manufacturing in Uzbek', '2026-07-26 00:16:44', '2026-07-26 00:16:44'),
